      "writtenOn": "2018-03-09T08:35:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CM32181E\u0027s refresh time can be determined by PSM and ALS_IT.\n(Refer the TABLE 2 in spec) \nIn this case, \nwe didn\u0027t set command 0x03(PSM at bit2:1) and it default as 0x0000.\nWe just set command 0x00(ALS_IT at bit 9:6) as 0x00C0.\nThose two settings will determine the refresh time as 1300ms.\nIs this quick enough for Chromebook?\n\nYou are right, I did have a miscalculation.\nIn conclusion, \nNami default freq: 1/1300ms is ~700mHz.\nAccording to the table2,\nCM32181E\u0027s maximum freq: 1/600ms is ~1500mHz.\nCM32181E\u0027s minimum freq: 1/4800ms is ~200mHz.",
      "parentUuid": "e5f77d72_c1fed222",
      "revId": "f6d0374bd89e00656aebb30d76616c16e11b24bc",
